  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many users rely heavily on the chatbox for communication. Well, many users rely on reading to use features in general. It would be nice for there to be an option for users to use OpenDyslexic, or other fonts that may assist dyslexic users.\n\nI'm making an effort to check with dyslexic users how my fonts feel, and while OpenDyslexic tends to improve readability, I've also found that Dyslexie tends to work better for most people.\n\nThe problem with Dyslexie is that unlike OpenDyslexic, Dyslexie is not free to use. I believe the best option would be to have multiple dyslexia-friendly fonts, (Comic Sans would be the easiest to include in that list), or allow custom fonts to be used. Custom fonts may be considered risky, which is a fair concern, so I'd at least request that more than 1 font is added so users can adjust to whatever their needs are.",
